{"speciesId":517,"names":{"fr":"Munna","es":"Munna","en":"Munna","ja":"ムンナ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Quand Munna mange un rêve, celui-ci est aussitôt oublié par le rêveur. Il lévite en permanence."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Munna always float in the air. People whose dreams are eaten by them forget what the dreams had been about."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il se nourrit des rêves des gens et des Pokémon. Quand le rêve est agréable, il crache une fumée rose."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It eats the dreams of people and Pokémon. When it eats a pleasant dream, it expels pink-colored mist."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"This Pokémon appears before people and Pokémon who are having nightmares and eats those dreams."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"This Pokémon appears before people and Pokémon who are having nightmares and eats those dreams."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il apparaît aux humains et aux Pokémon qui font des mauvais rêves et mange leurs cauchemars pour les en libérer."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Cuando un humano o un Pokémon sufre una pesadilla, Munna se aparece ante ellos y la engulle."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"This Pokémon appears before people and Pokémon who are having nightmares and eats those dreams."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"悪い 夢に うなされている ポケモンや 人の 前に 現われ その夢を 食べてしまう ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il se nourrit des rêves des gens et des Pokémon. Quand le rêve est agréable, il crache une fumée rose."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Se alimenta de los sueños de humanos y Pokémon. Si los sueños son felices, despide humo rosa."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It eats the dreams of people and Pokémon. When it eats a pleasant dream, it expels pink-colored mist."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"人や ポケモンが 見た 夢を 食べる。楽しい 夢を 食べると ピンク色の けむりを 吐き出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il apparaît aux humains et aux Pokémon qui font des mauvais rêves et mange leurs cauchemars pour les en libérer."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Cuando un humano o un Pokémon sufre una pesadilla, Munna se aparece ante ellos y la engulle."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"This Pokémon appears before people and Pokémon who are having nightmares and eats those dreams."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"悪い 夢に うなされている ポケモンや 人の 前に 現われ その夢を 食べてしまう ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il se nourrit des rêves des gens et des Pokémon. Quand le rêve est agréable, il crache une fumée rose."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Se alimenta de los sueños de humanos y Pokémon. Si los sueños son felices, despide humo rosa."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It eats the dreams of people and Pokémon. When it eats a pleasant dream, it expels pink-colored mist."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"人や ポケモンが 見た 夢を 食べる。楽しい 夢を 食べると ピンク色の けむりを 吐き出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il apparaît en pleine nuit, à côté de l’oreiller. Quand il se nourrit de rêves, les motifs de son corps luisent légèrement."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Aparece en plena noche junto a la almohada de la gente. Cuando devora los sueños, los motivos de su cuerpo emiten una luz tenue."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Late at night, it appears beside people’s pillows. As it feeds on dreams, the patterns on its body give off a faint glow."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"深夜 枕元に 現れる。 夢を 食べているとき 体の 模様が ぼんやりと 光る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il se nourrit de songes et expire de la fumée qui prend la couleur rose si le rêve est joyeux, ou noire s’il s’agit d’un cauchemar."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"El humo que despide cambia de color en función del sueño que haya consumido. 